  helperWasUsedOnThisArticleState: 0
  articleID: https://NewManilaAudits/Recents
  title: Ghost Projects
  headliner: <b>Auditors Uncover Massive "Ghost" Flood-Control Infrastructure Scam</b>
  bodyText: "Pure unfiltered anger has erupted across New Manila after state auditors
    exposed a sweeping multi-billion-peso corruption scheme involving hundreds of
    \"completed\" flood-control river walls and drainage dikes that do not actually
    exist. \r\n\r\n\r\nMore about this story : \r\n"
  externalLinkBodyText: 'The scandal exploded into public view after severe monsoon
    rains submerged low-lying districts despite government officials boasting that
    thousands of flood-mitigation structures had already been built and fully paid
    for. Subsequent satellite inspections and field audits revealed that dozens of
    high-value contracts awarded to a handful of favored contractors consisted entirely
    of falsified completion reports, empty riverbanks, or decades-old walls passed
    off as brand-new construction. '
  hasExternalLink: 1
  customComments:
  - FIX THE DRAINS NOW !
  - THIS IS WHERE MY TAXES GO ?!
  - CORRUPTION WILL BE THE DEATH OF ALL
  - WHYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYY ?
